  "key": "pr-1203",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "fix(kicker): wake machine-sm on CI conclusions (workflow_run)",
    "description": "Parity with epam/dmtools-dart#338. Live evidence from dmtools-dart today: both crons (machine-sm */10 + kicker 13,43) starved for 100 minutes; the green validation verdict for dart#337 sat unlatched the whole window (Quality success 16:47 → merge 17:22 only after a manual tick dispatch).\n\nThis kicker gains a `workflow_run: [CI] completed` trigger: verdict latching, FIFO arming and merges react to CI conclusions within seconds, cron or no cron. Thin-stub change only — all logic stays pinned in awf (same pin as machine-sm.yml)."
  }
}

